# Italian changes what it is handed: an n before a k or a g becomes the velar
# nasal, and a mid vowel is closed or opened by where it stands. That is
# Italian, and a module that is to say another language's phones has to say
# them as they were given.
rule make_ital_phon_adjustments takes 3 from it_phnol.obj
  afresh
  call ZZfence_null
  match
end
